# The Three Kingdoms Bastok (Windurst 2-3, mission.windurst.the_three_kingdoms_bastok). A level 30 Warrior of Windurst
# in Metalworks with the mission current (a GM; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Status 0: Grohm 422 (his
# own default is 422 too: a fake check pins the mission's); Pius answers his own default 350; Mih Ketto 267, Moyoyo 264,
# Topuru-Kuperu 261. Status 3: Grohm 422; Pius 355 with parameter 1, whose finish sets status 4; Pius then 350 (his
# own). Status 4: Grohm 423, whose finish gives five Pickaxes and sets status 5. Status 5 without the Mythril Sand:
# Grohm 424; with it: 422. Patt-Pott takes the sand with 255, whose finish completes the mission (no reward table),
# takes the sand, sets status 7 and begins The Three Kingdoms; Grohm then answers his own 422.
lists Metalworks/Grohm/onTrigger Metalworks/Pius/onTrigger Metalworks/Patt-Pott/onTrade Metalworks/Mih_Ketto/onTrigger Metalworks/Moyoyo/onTrigger Metalworks/Topuru-Kuperu/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/255 Metalworks/onEventFinish/355 Metalworks/onEventFinish/423 Metalworks/onEventFinish/425
char zone=Metalworks pos=-18,-11,-27 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Windurst TheThreeKingdomsBastok current
login
trigger Grohm                           # status 0: 422
finish-if-event
trigger Pius                            # nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
trigger Mih_Ketto                       # 267
finish-if-event
trigger Moyoyo                          # 264
finish-if-event
trigger Topuru-Kuperu                   # 261
finish-if-event
missionstatus Windurst 3
trigger Grohm
finish-if-event
trigger Pius                            # 355
finish                                  # status 4
trigger Pius
finish-if-event
trigger Grohm                           # 423
finish                                  # five Pickaxes, status 5
trigger Grohm                           # 424
finish-if-event
item OnzOfMythrilSand
trigger Grohm                           # 422
finish-if-event
walk 23,-17,40
trade Patt-Pott OnzOfMythrilSand x1     # 255
finish                                  # completed, status 7, The Three Kingdoms begun
trigger Grohm
finish-if-event
